{"overview":"پس از تجسد به‌عنوان یک سلاح هوشیار با خاطرات زندگی گذشته‌اش اما بدون نام، شمشیر جادویی یک دختر حیوانی جوان را از زندگی برده‌داری نجات می‌دهد. فران، دختری با گوش‌های گربه‌ای، او را در دست می‌گیرد و فقط می‌خواهد قوی‌تر شود، در حالی که شمشیر می‌خواهد بداند چرا او در اینجا است. سفر عجیب این دو، تازه شروع شده است!","tagline":"","overview_en":"Reincarnated as a sentient weapon with memories of his past life, but not his name, a magical sword saves a young beastgirl from a life of slavery. Fran, the cat-eared girl, becomes his wielder, and wants only to grow stronger, while the sword wants to know why he is here. Together, the strange duo's journey has only just begun!","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2022,"poster":"/zvWXxUHi4a2VzEyDS9B88dEeOJZ.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/6XllUytvCgpwDHcCVcrA0iJfSYB.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","CN"],"cast":[{"name":"三木眞一郎","role":"Master (voice)","photo":"/yL9Tx2HZgK7t5AssYl6oGE9bjdj.jpg","en":"Shin-ichiro Miki"},{"name":"加隈亜衣","role":"Fran (voice)","photo":"/o3tQSeeJAeafJNvQs2IKvpKY7av.jpg","en":"Ai Kakuma"},{"name":"小清水亜美","role":"Amanda (voice)","photo":"/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg","en":"Ami Koshimizu"},{"name":"羽多野渉","role":"Klimt (voice)","photo":"/i1meHlOXLP2ubJZkmyGJONrxikQ.jpg","en":"Wataru Hatano"},{"name":"稲田徹","role":"Donadrond (voice)","photo":"/hN6WVTxPAd4Jbc9iqWwoWFthT6p.jpg","en":"Tetsu Inada"},{"name":"大久保瑠美","role":"Nell (voice)","photo":"/cf4cnFMllu1yO3X0gCGGDdl8GXW.jpg","en":"Rumi Okubo"},{"name":"辻親八","role":"Garrus (voice)","photo":"/af5ILJbixauO84bsuLOr8XSU9yd.jpg","en":"Shinpachi Tsuji"}],"trailer":"nY7vu0EKWZI","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/134667/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"HiDive","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/1743zXk6Hn0afaarNtp6bXVMlsT.png"},{"n":"Hidive Amazon Channel","k